  "narration": {
    "$comment": "{display|spoken} pairs keep on-screen captions exact while the TTS engine gets a phonetic respelling. 'start' is the earliest start; lines are snapped to the half-beat grid and pushed later if the previous line is still speaking.",
    "voice": {"engine": "rhvoice", "profile": "bdl", "rate": 115, "pitch": 100},
    "minGapSec": 0.25,
    "lines": [
      {"id": "a1_l1", "act": "act1", "start": 2.8, "text": "Welcome to {MPD|M P D} Industries' greenfield resin plant in {Ujjain|oo jane}."},
      {"id": "a1_l2", "act": "act1", "start": 7.0, "text": "Two plants, {22|twenty-two} reactors, around {6,900|sixty-nine hundred} tons of output every month."},
      {"id": "a2_l1", "act": "act2", "start": 15.5, "text": "It starts with storage: two warehouses with mobile compact racking hold {2,904|twenty-nine hundred and four} pallets, about {1,500|fifteen hundred} tons."},
      {"id": "a2_l2", "act": "act2", "start": 25.3, "text": "A {depalletiser|dee palletizer} turns bagged raw materials into {one-tonne|one ton} jumbo bags for fast charging, and {600 KL|six hundred kiloliters} of underground {PESO|peso} tanks hold the solvents."},
      {"id": "a3_l1", "act": "act3", "start": 40.0, "text": "In Plant {1|one}, an overhead crane lifts each jumbo bag straight up to the reactor charging deck."},
      {"id": "a3_l2", "act": "act3", "start": 48.6, "text": "Ten reactors up to {16 KL|sixteen kiloliters} make saturated polyester, alkyds, and modified epoxy: {4,373|four thousand, three hundred and seventy-three} tons a month."},
      {"id": "a4_l1", "act": "act4", "start": 64.2, "text": "Plant {2|two} adds specialty and solid resins, finished on flakers, {pelletisers|pelletizers}, and crushers."},
      {"id": "a4_l2", "act": "act4", "start": 70.6, "text": "Polyamide, powder polyester, acrylic polyols, phenolics, and {R&D|R and D} scale-up: {2,530|twenty-five hundred and thirty} tons a month."},
      {"id": "a5_l1", "act": "act5", "start": 85.0, "text": "Every batch is released by our state-of-the-art {QC|Q C} lab, with a dedicated application lab that tests coatings the way your customers use them."},
      {"id": "a5_l2", "act": "act5", "start": 95.6, "text": "Both plants are run from one central control room."},
      {"id": "a6_l1", "act": "act6", "start": 101.8, "text": "Twelve blenders add {380 KL|three hundred and eighty kiloliters} of blending, and {22|twenty-two} grade-dedicated tanks hold over {1,000 KL|one thousand kiloliters} of finished goods."},
      {"id": "a6_l2", "act": "act6", "start": 111.2, "text": "In total: about {1,500|fifteen hundred} tons of packed storage, and over {1,600 KL|sixteen hundred kiloliters} of bulk liquids."},
      {"id": "a7_l1", "act": "act7", "start": 120.6, "text": "Utilities run green: agro-waste fired thermic heaters, fed from a covered fuel shed, and a {2,200 TR|twenty-two hundred T R} cooling tower."},
      {"id": "a7_l2", "act": "act7", "start": 130.0, "text": "On-site nitrogen, a {50 KLD|fifty kiloliter per day} effluent treatment plant, and {0.7 MW|point seven megawatts} of rooftop solar."},
      {"id": "a8_l1", "act": "act8", "start": 151.0, "text": "Toll conversion, full-service {jobwork|job work}, or dedicated capacity: partner with {MPD|M P D} Industries."},
      {"id": "a8_l2", "act": "act8", "start": 157.5, "text": "Every model comes with {NDA|N D A} confidentiality, segregated storage, and a scale-up path from {2 KL|two kiloliter} trials to {16 KL|sixteen kiloliter} production."},
      {"id": "a8_l3", "act": "act8", "start": 172.5, "text": "{MPD|M P D} Industries. We innovate. We serve."}
    ]
  },
